{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-paths","title":"学习路径","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-stack-learning","title":"技术栈学习路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/tech-stack-learning","wordCount":1392,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"domain-knowledge-transfer","title":"领域知识传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/domain-knowledge-transfer","wordCount":1549,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"mentoring-buddy-system","title":"导师与伙伴体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/learning-paths/mentoring-buddy-system","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h1><p>技术团队的知识传递往往依赖「坐旁边问」这种不可扩展的模式。当团队分布式化、新人批量到来时，这种模式迅速崩溃。本章将知识传递分解为三个结构化维度：技术栈的系统学习路径（让新人按正确顺序掌握工具链）、领域知识的显式传递（把隐性的业务理解变成可消费的资产）、以及导师与伙伴体系的制度化设计（让人际知识传递有节奏、有保障）。</p>\n<p>三篇文档互相补充：技术栈学习解决「会用工具」，领域知识传递解决「理解业务」，导师体系解决「有人带路」。</p>\n"}